      "sourceTextSha256": "393ca0953e2ab049178271a6293978da08debfd18a5d74bf62200debc0b2394a",
      "text": "Day 3 · City tour and Sugar Loaf Mountain (4 hours, shared tour). After breakfast, the first stop is Urca Hill, with a wide viewing area and a restaurant and bar; from Sugar Loaf, enjoy a beautiful view of Rio, Copacabana Beach, the bay, the mountains, the ocean islands, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and the statue of Christ on Corcovado. Then drive to the historic centre of old Rio to admire old churches, monasteries, the city’s Cathedral and colonial-style buildings.",
